        "y0": 0.7349561081328636,
        "x1": 0.9220102771692413,
        "y1": 0.746240242639747
      },
      "text": "s4 cases were more likely to be allowed or remitted (75%, compared with 62% of s95 cases). s95 appeals were marginally more",
