        "y0": 0.7492097517205057,
        "x1": 0.9315326593703686,
        "y1": 0.760493886227389
      },
      "text": "likely to be dismissed (27% of s95 cases were dismissed compared with 24% of s4 cases). We believe this difference was due to the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
